      "description": "The Red Brick Office is located in the office on the side of the factory. After the brick kiln factory stopped production, it was still used until 2002 before evacuating all employees.Sitting on a two-story red brick building facing south, the space is square and has a porch, a balcony, and a total of 10 windows on the front and east and west sides.It has been listed as a national historical site.",
